      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تضجّع فِى الأَمْرِ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>He held back in the affair,</i>
(S, K, TA,) <i>and did not undertake it.</i> (S, TA.)
[See also 1, and 2, and 6.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تضجّع السَّحَابُ</span>
(tropical:)  <i>The clouds continued raining</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَبَّ</span>) <i>in the place.</i>
(S, K, TA.)

